n's Sister\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/adXs7wY8JlryfpEObDhzqu5oY0P.jpg\"},{\"id\":1167484,\"name\":\"Jenny Tschernichin-Larsson\",\"character\":\"Ivan's Mother\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fMBV3u2M0oRv9znfAPFnRgSfHfX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1824679,\"name\":\"Georg Grönroos\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bW92KoHZ8QnmHcHPUwjuyfYL4gM.jpg\"},{\"id\":1503367,\"name\":\"Sven Quick\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1026167,\"name\":\"Agda Helin\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mWlOBdhd6khYEjeye0qC6PPSwzg.jpg\"},{\"id\":1321989,\"name\":\"Olof Ås\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i6rPGlwV1eOtwhyWFu9h9zmctkZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1188940,\"name\":\"Justus Hagman\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uFUTKgebR0m9NVacdYxpKUNETag.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":383709,\"title\":\"Wonderstruck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hPnW1yWlIJcKCEQ5Kbr5dMtrDp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bI9VoPV1gYpBw4yjbYzWwhTh92g.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of a young boy in the Midwest is told simultaneously with a tale about a young girl in New York from fifty years ago as they both seek the same mysterious connection.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1081676,\"title\":\"Forgotten Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1THDAakV8hmbRC9YIqJ9SngVinr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1bOCozOQOxJpk0iAQbJDS2w8OJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A once-respected surgeon who's lost his family and his memory gets a chance at redemption when he reconnects with someone from his forgotten past.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40713,\"title\":\"Sky of Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9JiXOxIpTvkq7ewp8YQoY8vqse3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vDEM9XXWpaUb5sxDzpcEGBXgzIx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mika is a fresh high school student who starts texting a mysterious boy. She is shocked when he reveals who he is - Hiro, a delinquent attending her school. What she doesn't know is that Hiro isn't as bad as he seems.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475888,\"title\":\"Tell It to the Bees\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Rj6zpHhMU1zFW3v28U4PSRSRgP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Oeo4ZabmekrqCQyn34SI95692d.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Jean Markham returns to the town she left as a teenager to take over her late father's medical practice. When a school-yard scuffle lands Charlie in her surgery, she invites him to visit the hives in her garden and tell his secrets to the bees, as she once did. The new friendship between the boy and the bee keeper brings his mother Lydia into Jean's world.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21325,\"title\":\"Onmyoji\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ptiwNaV092Ut3qWLnN07fx2hFjl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/if0IBbnzdeacoGf2Dgj1dAqZktu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a dark time in the Heian period, when evil forces threaten the kingdom, the emperor relies on the onmyōji to keep the supernatural forces in line. But as political events become highly charged, friction within the order leads to betrayal. Now, Seimei, a talented member of the clan, must face down his master, Dōson, in the hopes of restoring peace to the kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475928,\"title\":\"School's Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2aaIB3qOIe1QucA1qO1TbhJ7veS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mq31oGhJbvz5jvCDHkYoeX3qWRg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pierre Hoffman joins a prestigious school as a substitute teacher and soon notices, among some of his students, an unjustified hostility and a spark of violence in their eyes. Is it because the unspeakable tragedy they have just experienced? Is it because they seem to be extraordinarily gifted children? Is it because they have lost all hope for the future? From curiosity to obsession, Pierre will try to unlock their secret.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40787,\"title\":\"The Guy in the Grave Next Door\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bPe1ZPMPTxvnWYHShSH29LvX7V7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jhq8rurRTNlLaahVZYvF2k6tGMc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Desirée, a modern librarian with urban friends and interests is visiting her late husband's grave when she meets Benny, a simple farmer. After his mother's death Benny lives alone on the run-down farm, desperately seeking a woman to take care of him. In spite of their differences the two have the dream of finding that special someone in common, and fall passionately in love. Benny wants Desirée to move in with him and start a family as soon as possible. But being a farmer's wife is not something she is very enthusiastic about. Just presenting Benny as her boyfriend proves to be an embarrassing experience. And when she gets a tempting job offer in Stockholm she has to consider her priorities carefully.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21447,\"title\":\"The Nautical Chart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s24q6D6MNejvV8hcMIeZtfm2F9T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xnXhT142QwOXgUamD6olSASLnmC.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Coy, a sailor without ship, banished from the sea by a navigation accident occurred during his guard, knows in an auction of naval objects in Barcelona to an attractive and mysterious woman, Tangier. This, in hard struggle with an Italian adventurer, Nino Palermo, manages to get a cartographic jewel of eighteen, the Maritime Atlas of Urrutia.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":305291,\"title\":\"The Orchard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nLTcwnxkD7OpoHcQaRVt90anrvA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on Anton Chekhov's classic play, The Orchard is an eccentric comedy about class struggles in Russia at the turn of the 20th century. An aging aristocratic lady returns home to face the loss of her magnificent cherry orchard estate.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Af5hemr8rdo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"J3-JphBHjpA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"_fIP4HQ_YCI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}